  "details": "As someone who has VRC+, in my opinion adding prints to VRC+ is giving me an advantage over other users. This is not what VRC+ is suppose to do. It would be better if you will give 30 SLOTS, to none VRC+ users for saving those pictures. But in NO PLACE, making it VRC+ exclusive and not giving them the option to use it what so ever. Prints are awesome to send pictures or show them to other people in game. It's a quality of life addition that should not be behind a pay wall.\n\nSo the easiest solution is:\n\nNone VRC+: 30 slots for saving pictures of Prints.\n\nVRC+: 100 slots for saving pictures of Prints.",
